<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SafiScreen — Shariah-Compliant Stock Screening</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0A0A0F;
  --bg-elev1:#111117;
  --bg-elev2:#16161F;
  --bg-elev3:#1C1C28;
  --border:#26262F;
  --border-soft:#1E1E28;
  --text:#F5F5F7;
  --text-dim:#A0A0AC;
  --text-faint:#6B6B78;
  --green:#10B981;
  --green-dim:#0D8F68;
  --green-bg:rgba(16,185,129,0.10);
  --red:#EF4444;
  --red-bg:rgba(239,68,68,0.10);
  --amber:#F59E0B;
  --amber-bg:rgba(245,158,11,0.10);
  --gold:#D4AF37;
  --shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
body{
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;
  min-height:100vh;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(circle at 15% 0%, rgba(16,185,129,0.06), transparent 40%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 85% 20%, rgba(212,175,55,0.05), transparent 35%);
  background-attachment:fixed;
}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer;}
input{font-family:inherit;}
::selection{background:var(--green);color:#04140D;}
.mono{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;}

/* ---------- Scrollbar ---------- */
::-webkit-scrollbar{width:10px;height:10px;}
::-webkit-scrollbar-track{background:var(--bg);}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--border);border-radius:6px;}
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover{background:#33333f;}

/* ---------- Layout ---------- */
.app-shell{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
.container{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;width:100%;}
main{flex:1;}

/* ---------- Navbar ---------- */
.navbar{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;
  background:rgba(10,10,15,0.75);
  backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-soft);
  transition:border-color .2s, background .2s;
}
.navbar.scrolled{background:rgba(10,10,15,0.92);border-bottom-color:var(--border);}
.nav-inner{
  max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:14px 24px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;}
.brand-mark{
  width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green), var(--gold));
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:17px;font-weight:900;color:#04140D;
  box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(16,185,129,0.35);
}
.brand-name span{color:var(--gold);}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;}
.nav-link{
  padding:9px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600;font-size:14.5px;
  color:var(--text-dim);transition:all .15s;
}
.nav-link:hover{color:var(--text);background:var(--bg-elev2);}
.nav-link.active{color:var(--green);background:var(--green-bg);}
.hamburger{display:none;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;background:none;border:none;padding:8px;}
.hamburger span{width:22px;height:2px;background:var(--text);border-radius:2px;transition:.2s;}
.mobile-menu{display:none;flex-direction:column;padding:8px 24px 16px;gap:4px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-soft);background:var(--bg-elev1);}
.mobile-menu.open{display:flex;}
.mobile-menu .nav-link{width:100%;}

@media (max-width:820px){
  .nav-links{display:none;}
  .hamburger{display:flex;}
}

/* ---------- Buttons ---------- */
.btn{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;
  padding:13px 26px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid transparent;
  font-weight:700;font-size:15px;transition:all .15s;
  white-space:nowrap;
}
.btn-primary{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--green),var(--green-dim));
  color:#04140D;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(16,185,129,0.28);
}
.btn-primary:hover{filter:brightness(1.08);transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(16,185,129,0.38);}
.btn-secondary{
  background:var(--bg-elev2);color:var(--text);border-color:var(--border);
}
.btn-secondary:hover{background:var(--bg-elev3);border-color:#3a3a48;}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--text-dim);border-color:var(--border);}
.btn-ghost:hover{color:var(--text);border-color:#3a3a48;}
.btn-sm{padding:8px 14px;font-size:13.5px;border-radius:8px;}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed;transform:none;}

/* ---------- Hero ---------- */
.hero{padding:88px 24px 60px;text-align:center;position:relative;}
.hero-badge{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  background:var(--bg-elev2);border:1px solid var(--border);
  padding:7px 16px;border-radius:100px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;
  color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:28px;
}
.hero-badge .dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--green);}
.hero h1{
  font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,64px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-0.03em;
  line-height:1.08;margin-bottom:20px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff 30%,#c9c9d4 100%);
  -webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
}
.hero p.sub{
  font-size:clamp(15px,2vw,19px);color:var(--text-dim);max-width:600px;
  margin:0 auto 44px;line-height:1.6;
}
.search-box{
  max-width:620px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;gap:10px;
  background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--border);
  padding:8px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);
}
.search-box input{
  flex:1;background:transparent;border:none;outline:none;
  color:var(--text);font-size:17px;padding:12px 16px;font-weight:600;
  letter-spacing:0.02em;
}
.search-box input::placeholder{color:var(--text-faint);font-weight:500;}
.search-box .btn{border-radius:11px;}

.recent-pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin-top:22px;}
.pill{
  background:var(--bg-elev2);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text-dim);
  padding:7px 14px;border-radius:100px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:600;
  transition:all .15s;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;
}
.pill:hover{border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green);}

.search-error{
  max-width:620px;margin:16px auto 0;color:var(--red);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;
  background:var(--red-bg);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,0.3);padding:10px 16px;border-radius:10px;
}

/* ---------- Stat cards ---------- */
.stats-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;
  max-width:1000px;margin:64px auto 0;
}
.stat-card{
  background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;
  padding:24px 20px;text-align:left;transition:border-color .2s, transform .2s;
}
.stat-card:hover{border-color:#33333f;transform:translateY(-2px);}
.stat-card .val{font-size:28px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:4px;}
.stat-card .lbl{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-faint);font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;}
.stat-card.accent .val{color:var(--green);}
.stat-card.gold .val{color:var(--gold);font-size:19px;}

@media (max-width:760px){
  .stats-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  .hero{padding:56px 18px 40px;}
}

/* ---------- Section heading generic ---------- */
.page{padding:48px 0 80px;animation:fadeIn .35s ease;}
@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}

/* ---------- Loading skeleton ---------- */
.skeleton-wrap{padding:40px 0;}
.skel{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--bg-elev1) 25%,var(--bg-elev2) 50%,var(--bg-elev1) 75%);
  background-size:200% 100%;animation:shimmer 1.4s infinite;border-radius:10px;}
@keyframes shimmer{0%{background-position:200% 0;}100%{background-position:-200% 0;}}
.skel-header{height:90px;margin-bottom:20px;}
.skel-badge{height:60px;width:220px;margin:0 auto 32px;border-radius:100px;}
.skel-row{height:280px;border-radius:16px;}
.skel-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;}
@media (max-width:760px){.skel-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}

/* ---------- Results page ---------- */
.company-header{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;
  background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius:16px;padding:26px 28px;margin-bottom:28px;
}
.company-logo{
  width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--bg-elev3);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;overflow:hidden;
  border:1px solid var(--border);flex-shrink:0;
}
.company-logo img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;}
.company-logo .fallback{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;color:var(--gold);}
.company-meta{flex:1;min-width:200px;}
.company-meta h2{font-size:23px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.01em;margin-bottom:2px;}
.company-meta .ticker-tag{
  font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:var(--green);font-weight:700;font-size:14px;
  background:var(--green-bg);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;margin-left:8px;
}
.company-meta .sub-meta{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:14px;margin-top:6px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.company-price{text-align:right;}
.company-price .price{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;}
.company-price .mcap{color:var(--text-faint);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-top:2px;}

.verdict-badge{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;
  max-width:340px;margin:0 auto 36px;padding:18px 30px;border-radius:100px;
  font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.02em;border:1.5px solid;
}
.verdict-badge .icon{font-size:26px;}
.verdict-badge.pass{background:var(--green-bg);border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green);}
.verdict-badge.fail{background:var(--red-bg);border-color:var(--red);color:var(--red);}
.verdict-badge.doubtful{background:var(--amber-bg);border-color:var(--amber);color:var(--amber);}

.panels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-bottom:24px;}
@media (max-width:820px){.panels{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.panel{
  background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;
  padding:24px;
}
.panel h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;
  color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:18px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.activity-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;}
.activity-item{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  padding:12px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--bg-elev2);
  border:1px solid var(--border-soft);font-size:14.5px;font-weight:600;
}
.activity-item .status{font-size:16px;}
.activity-item.fail-item{border-color:rgba(239,68,68,0.35);background:var(--red-bg);}
.activity-item.pass-item .status{color:var(--green);}
.activity-item.fail-item .status{color:var(--red);}

.ratio-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13.5px;}
.ratio-table th{
  text-align:left;color:var(--text-faint);font-weight:700;font-size:11.5px;
  text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
}
.ratio-table td{padding:12px 6px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-soft);vertical-align:top;}
.ratio-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}
.ratio-name{font-weight:700;color:var(--text);}
.ratio-formula{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--text-faint);margin-top:4px;line-height:1.5;}
.ratio-val{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-weight:700;}
.ratio-status{font-weight:800;font-size:12px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:6px;display:inline-block;white-space:nowrap;}
.ratio-status.pass{color:var(--green);background:var(--green-bg);}
.ratio-status.fail{color:var(--red);background:var(--red-bg);}
.ratio-status.doubtful{color:var(--amber);background:var(--amber-bg);}

.verdict-box{
  background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;
  padding:26px 28px;margin-bottom:28px;border-left:4px solid var(--border);
}
.verdict-box.pass{border-left-color:var(--green);}
.verdict-box.fail{border-left-color:var(--red);}
.verdict-box.doubtful{border-left-color:var(--amber);}
.verdict-box h4{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:8px;}
.verdict-box p{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;}

.results-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;}

/* ---------- Watchlist ---------- */
.page-head{margin-bottom:32px;}
.page-head h1{font-size:32px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-bottom:8px;}
.page-head p{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:15px;}
.watchlist-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(260px,1fr));gap:18px;}
.wl-card{
  background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;
  padding:20px;transition:border-color .2s, transform .2s;position:relative;cursor:pointer;
}
.wl-card:hover{border-color:#33333f;transform:translateY(-2px);}
.wl-card-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:14px;}
.wl-card .tk{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-weight:800;font-size:17px;}
.wl-card .nm{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:13px;margin-top:2px;max-width:170px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;}
.wl-remove{
  background:var(--bg-elev2);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text-faint);
  width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:16px;line-height:1;transition:all .15s;flex-shrink:0;
}
.wl-remove:hover{color:var(--red);border-color:var(--red);background:var(--red-bg);}
.wl-card-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;}
.wl-date{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-faint);}
.badge-sm{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:100px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.03em;}
.badge-sm.pass{background:var(--green-bg);color:var(--green);}
.badge-sm.fail{background:var(--red-bg);color:var(--red);}
.badge-sm.doubtful{background:var(--amber-bg);color:var(--amber);}
.empty-state{
  text-align:center;padding:80px 20px;color:var(--text-faint);
  border:1px dashed var(--border);border-radius:16px;
}
.empty-state .icn{font-size:44px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.empty-state h3{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px;}

/* ---------- Compare ---------- */
.compare-inputs{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;margin-bottom:28px;}
@media (max-width:760px){.compare-inputs{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.compare-input-wrap{
  background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;
  padding:10px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
}
.compare-input-wrap input{
  flex:1;background:transparent;border:none;outline:none;color:var(--text);
  font-size:15px;font-weight:700;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;text-transform:uppercase;
}
.compare-input-wrap .num{
  width:22px;height:22px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--bg-elev3);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;color:var(--gold);flex-shrink:0;
}
.compare-table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;background:var(--bg-elev1);}
.compare-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:560px;}
.compare-table th, .compare-table td{padding:14px 18px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-soft);font-size:13.5px;}
.compare-table th{background:var(--bg-elev2);font-weight:700;color:var(--text-dim);text-transform:uppercase;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.04em;position:sticky;top:0;}
.compare-table td.crit-label{font-weight:700;color:var(--text-dim);white-space:nowrap;}
.compare-table td.cell-pass{color:var(--green);font-weight:700;background:rgba(16,185,129,0.06);}
.compare-table td.cell-fail{color:var(--red);font-weight:700;background:rgba(239,68,68,0.06);}
.compare-table td.cell-doubtful{color:var(--amber);font-weight:700;background:rgba(245,158,11,0.06);}
.compare-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}

/* ---------- About / Methodology ---------- */
.method-section{margin-bottom:36px;}
.method-section h2{font-size:22px;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:14px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;}
.method-section h2 .accent{color:var(--green);}
.method-section p{color:var(--text-dim);line-height:1.75;font-size:15px;margin-bottom:12px;}
.crit-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-top:16px;}
.crit-row{
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;
  background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;
  padding:14px 18px;font-size:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.crit-row .cname{font-weight:700;}
.crit-row .cthresh{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:var(--gold);font-weight:700;font-size:13px;}
.about-card{
  background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;
  padding:26px;display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;margin-top:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.about-avatar{
  width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:14px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),#8a6d1f);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:900;font-size:20px;color:#1a1305;flex-shrink:0;
}
.about-card .who b{font-size:16px;}
.about-card .who div{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:13.5px;margin-top:3px;}

/* ---------- Toast ---------- */
.toast{
  position:fixed;bottom:26px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(20px);
  background:var(--bg-elev3);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);
  padding:13px 22px;border-radius:12px;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);z-index:1000;opacity:0;transition:all .25s;pointer-events:none;
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
}
.toast.show{opacity:1;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0);}
.toast .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);}

/* ---------- Error state ---------- */
.error-box{
  max-width:520px;margin:60px auto;text-align:center;padding:40px 30px;
  background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--red);border-radius:16px;
}
.error-box .icn{font-size:36px;margin-bottom:14px;}
.error-box h3{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--red);}
.error-box p{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:20px;}

/* ---------- Footer ---------- */
footer{
  border-top:1px solid var(--border-soft);padding:26px 24px;text-align:center;
  color:var(--text-faint);font-size:13px;
}
footer .gold{color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;}

/* ---------- Autocomplete ---------- */
.search-wrap{position:relative;}
.autocomplete-dropdown{
  position:absolute;top:calc(100% + 8px);left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
  width:100%;max-width:620px;
  background:var(--bg-elev2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;
  box-shadow:var(--shadow);z-index:50;overflow:hidden;display:none;text-align:left;
}
.autocomplete-dropdown.open{display:block;}
.ac-item{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;cursor:pointer;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-soft);font-size:14px;}
.ac-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
.ac-item:hover{background:var(--bg-elev3);}
.ac-item .ac-sym{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-weight:800;color:var(--green);flex-shrink:0;}
.ac-item .ac-name{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:13px;flex:1;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;text-align:right;}
.ac-item .ac-exch{color:var(--text-faint);font-size:11.5px;flex-shrink:0;}
.ac-loading, .ac-empty{padding:16px;text-align:center;color:var(--text-faint);font-size:13.5px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;}
.ac-spinner{width:14px;height:14px;border:2px solid var(--border);border-top-color:var(--green);border-radius:50%;animation:spin .7s linear infinite;}
@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}

.recent-searches-wrap{margin-top:22px;text-align:center;}
.recent-label{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--text-faint);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;margin-bottom:8px;}
.recent-pills{margin-top:0;}

/* ---------- Popular stocks ---------- */
.popular-section{max-width:1000px;margin:56px auto 0;text-align:left;}
.popular-section h3{font-size:13px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.05em;color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:16px;}
.popular-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px;}
@media (max-width:900px){.popular-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
@media (max-width:640px){.popular-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
.popular-card{
  background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;
  padding:16px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .15s;text-align:left;
}
.popular-card:hover{border-color:#33333f;transform:translateY(-2px);}
.popular-card .pc-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;}
.popular-card .pc-tk{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px;}
.popular-card .pc-name{color:var(--text-faint);font-size:12px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;}

/* ---------- Scan loading ---------- */
.scan-loading{max-width:520px;margin:60px auto;text-align:center;padding:20px;}
.scan-orb{
  width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;margin:0 auto 24px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle, var(--green) 0%, rgba(16,185,129,0.15) 70%);
  box-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(16,185,129,0.5);
  animation:pulseOrb 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes pulseOrb{
  0%,100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:1;}
  50%{transform:scale(1.15);opacity:0.75;}
}
.scan-ticker{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.02em;margin-bottom:4px;}
.scan-company{color:var(--text-dim);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:28px;min-height:20px;}
.scan-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;text-align:left;}
.scan-item{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;
  background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--border-soft);border-radius:10px;
  padding:10px 14px;font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-dim);
  animation:scanIn .25s ease;
}
@keyframes scanIn{from{opacity:0;transform:translateX(-6px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateX(0);}}
.scan-item .scan-check{color:var(--green);font-weight:800;}

/* ---------- Freshness note ---------- */
.freshness-note{color:var(--text-faint);font-size:12.5px;margin:10px 2px 24px;}

/* ---------- Enriched data grid ---------- */
.enrich-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:14px;margin-bottom:24px;}
@media (max-width:900px){.enrich-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}}
@media (max-width:560px){.enrich-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
.enrich-tile{background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;}
.enrich-tile .et-lbl{font-size:11px;color:var(--text-faint);font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;margin-bottom:6px;}
.enrich-tile .et-val{font-size:16px;font-weight:800;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;}

/* ---------- Price chart ---------- */
.chart-card{background:var(--bg-elev1);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:24px;}
.chart-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;margin-bottom:18px;}
.chart-stats .cs-price{font-size:26px;font-weight:800;font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;}
.chart-stats .cs-change{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;margin-top:4px;color:var(--text-faint);}
.chart-stats .cs-change.up{color:var(--green);}
.chart-stats .cs-change.down{color:var(--red);}
.range-btns{display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.range-btn{background:var(--bg-elev2);border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text-dim);padding:6px 13px;border-radius:8px;font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;transition:all .15s;}
.range-btn:hover{color:var(--text);}
.range-btn.active{background:var(--green-bg);border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green);}
.chart-canvas-wrap{position:relative;height:280px;}
.chart-empty{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%;text-align:center;color:var(--text-faint);font-size:13.5px;}

/* ---------- Purification ratio ---------- */
.purify-box{
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(212,175,55,0.08), rgba(212,175,55,0.02));
  border:1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.35);border-radius:16px;padding:24px 28px;margin-bottom:24px;
}
.purify-box h4{color:var(--gold);font-size:15px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;margin-bottom:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.purify-box .purify-formula{font-family:'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-dim);margin-bottom:10px;}
.purify-box .purify-note{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--text);}
.purify-box .purify-note b{color:var(--gold);}

/* ---------- Disclaimer banner ---------- */
.disclaimer-banner{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;
  background:var(--amber-bg);border:1px solid rgba(245,158,11,0.35);
  border-radius:12px;padding:14px 18px;margin-bottom:24px;
  color:#e8c072;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.5;
}
.disclaimer-banner .db-close{background:transparent;border:none;color:var(--amber);font-size:18px;line-height:1;flex-shrink:0;padding:4px;}

/* ---------- Print ---------- */
.print-footer{display:none;}
@media print{
  body{background:#fff !important;color:#111 !important;background-image:none !important;}
  .navbar, .hamburger, .mobile-menu, footer, .toast, .no-print{display:none !important;}
  .page{padding:0;}
  .company-header, .panel, .chart-card, .verdict-box, .purify-box, .enrich-tile, .stat-card, .popular-card{
    background:#fff !important;border:1px solid #ccc !important;color:#111 !important;box-shadow:none !important;
  }
  .verdict-badge{border:2px solid #333 !important;background:#fff !important;color:#111 !important;box-shadow:none !important;}
  .ratio-formula, .sub-meta, .freshness-note, .verdict-box p{color:#444 !important;}
  .print-footer{display:block !important;margin-top:24px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #ccc;color:#555;font-size:11px;text-align:center;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app-shell">
  <nav class="navbar" id="navbar">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="#/" class="brand" onclick="navigate('/');return false;">
        <div class="brand-mark">S</div>
        <div class="brand-name">Safi<span>Screen</span></div>
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links" id="navLinks"></div>
      <button class="hamburger" id="hamburgerBtn" aria-label="Menu"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>
    </div>
    <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobileMenu"></div>
  </nav>

  <main id="app" class="container"></main>

  <footer>
    Data provided by Financial Modeling Prep. Screening performed per AAOIFI standards for informational purposes only — not investment advice.
    <br>Built by <span class="gold">Abdullah Baig</span> · University of Waterloo
  </footer>
</div>

<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js"></script>
<script>
/* =======================================================================
   CONFIG
======================================================================= */
const FMP_API_KEY = 'm1q5g6rCOQxzGG0TBglvwP3mu4L10gNf';
const FMP_BASE = 'https://financialmodelingprep.com/stable';
const SHARE_BASE_URL = 'https://shariah-screener-ish8u1bdl-baigab.vercel.app/';
const POPULAR_TICKERS = ['AAPL','MSFT','GOOGL','TSLA','AMZN','META','NVDA','UBER','NFLX','JPM','V','MA'];

const HARAM_CATEGORIES = [
  { key:'banking', label:'Conventional Banking / Interest-Based Finance',
    industryKeywords:['bank','credit services','mortgage finance','financial conglomerate','savings & cooperative'] },
  { key:'insurance', label:'Conventional Insurance', industryKeywords:['insurance'] },
  { key:'alcohol', label:'Alcohol Production or Distribution',
    industryKeywords:['alcohol','brewer','distiller','winer'] },
  { key:'pork', label:'Pork Products', industryKeywords:[], keywords:['pork','swine','bacon'] },
  { key:'weapons', label:'Weapons & Defense', industryKeywords:['aerospace & defense','defense'] },
  { key:'gambling', label:'Gambling & Casinos', industryKeywords:['gambling','casino'] },
  { key:'adult', label:'Adult Entertainment', industryKeywords:[], keywords:['adult entertainment','pornograph'] },
  { key:'tobacco', label:'Tobacco', industryKeywords:['tobacco'] },
];

const RATIO_THRESHOLDS = {
  debtToAssets: { max:0.30, label:'Interest-Bearing Debt / Total Assets' },
  interestIncomeToRevenue: { max:0.05, label:'Interest Income / Total Revenue' },
  receivablesToAssets: { max:0.70, label:'Accounts Receivable / Total Assets' },
  illiquidToAssets: { min:0.33, label:'Illiquid Assets / Total Assets' },
};
const DOUBTFUL_MARGIN = 0.05; // within 5% (relative) of threshold => doubtful

/* =======================================================================
   STATE / STORAGE
======================================================================= */
const store = {
  get(key, fallback){ try{ const v = localStorage.getItem(key); return v ? JSON.parse(v) : fallback; }catch(e){ return fallback; } },
  set(key, val){ try{ localStorage.setItem(key, JSON.stringify(val)); }catch(e){} }
};
let recentSearches = store.get('safiscreen_recent', []);
let watchlist = store.get('safiscreen_watchlist', []);
let statsToday = store.get('safiscreen_stats', { count: 0, passes: 0, date: new Date().toDateString() });
if (statsToday.date !== new Date().toDateString()) { statsToday = { count:0, passes:0, date:new Date().toDateString() }; store.set('safiscreen_stats', statsToday); }

let currentResultsToken = 0;
let autocompleteRequestId = 0;
let priceChartInstance = null;
let priceHistoryCache = [];

/* =======================================================================
   ROUTER
======================================================================= */
const routes = {
  '/': renderLanding,
  '/results': renderResults,
  '/screen': renderResults,
  '/watchlist': renderWatchlist,
  '/compare': renderCompare,
  '/about': renderAbout,
};
const navItems = [
  { path:'/', label:'Screen' },
  { path:'/watchlist', label:'Watchlist' },
  { path:'/compare', label:'Compare' },
  { path:'/about', label:'Methodology' },
];

function currentPath(){
  const hash = location.hash.slice(1) || '/';
  return hash.split('?')[0];
}
function currentQuery(){
  const hash = location.hash.slice(1) || '/';
  const qIdx = hash.indexOf('?');
  return qIdx === -1 ? new URLSearchParams() : new URLSearchParams(hash.slice(qIdx+1));
}
function navigate(path, params){
  let h = '#' + path;
  if (params) { h += '?' + new URLSearchParams(params).toString(); }
  location.hash = h;
}
window.addEventListener('hashchange', router);
function router(){
  const path = currentPath();
  const fn = routes[path] || renderLanding;
  window.scrollTo({top:0, behavior:'instant'});
  buildNav(path);
  fn(currentQuery());
}

function buildNav(activePath){
  const linksHtml = navItems.map(n =>
    `<a href="#${n.path}" class="nav-link ${activePath===n.path?'active':''}">${n.label}</a>`
  ).join('');
  document.getElementById('navLinks').innerHTML = linksHtml;
  document.getElementById('mobileMenu').innerHTML = linksHtml;
}

document.getElementById('hamburgerBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
  document.getElementById('mobileMenu').classList.toggle('open');
});
document.getElementById('mobileMenu').addEventListener('click', (e) => {
  if (e.target.classList.contains('nav-link')) document.getElementById('mobileMenu').classList.remove('open');
});
window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
  document.getElementById('navbar').classList.toggle('scrolled', window.scrollY > 8);
});
document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
  const dropdown = document.getElementById('autocompleteDropdown');
  const input = document.getElementById('tickerInput');
  if (!dropdown) return;
  if (dropdown.contains(e.target) || e.target === input) return;
  closeAutocomplete();
});

/* =======================================================================
   TOAST
======================================================================= */
let toastTimer;
function showToast(msg){
  const t = document.getElementById('toast');
  t.innerHTML = `<span class="dot"></span>${msg}`;
  t.classList.add('show');
  clearTimeout(toastTimer);
  toastTimer = setTimeout(() => t.classList.remove('show'), 2600);
}

/* =======================================================================
   API
======================================================================= */
async function fmpFetch(endpoint){
  const sep = endpoint.includes('?') ? '&' : '?';
  const url = `${FMP_BASE}${endpoint}${sep}apikey=${FMP_API_KEY}`;
  let res;
  try{
    res = await fetch(url);
  }catch(e){
    throw { type:'network', message:'Network error — check your internet connection and try again.' };
  }
  if (res.status === 429) throw { type:'limit', message:'API rate limit reached. Please wait a moment and try again.' };
  if (res.status === 402) throw { type:'limit', message:'This data is not available under the current API subscription tier.' };
  if (!res.ok) throw { type:'network', message:`Request failed (HTTP ${res.status}). Please try again.` };
  let data;
  try{
    data = await res.json();
  }catch(e){
    throw { type:'network', message:'Received an unexpected response from the data provider. Please try again.' };
  }
  if (data && data['Error Message']) throw { type:'limit', message: data['Error Message'] };
  return data;
}

async function fetchCompanyData(ticker){
  const t = ticker.trim().toUpperCase();
  if (!t) throw { type:'invalid', message:'Please enter a stock ticker.' };
  const sym = encodeURIComponent(t);
  const [profileArr, incomeArr, balanceArr] = await Promise.all([
    fmpFetch(`/profile?symbol=${sym}`),
    fmpFetch(`/income-statement?symbol=${sym}&limit=1`),
    fmpFetch(`/balance-sheet-statement?symbol=${sym}&limit=1`),
  ]);
  if (!Array.isArray(profileArr) || profileArr.length === 0) {
    throw { type:'invalid', message:`No data found for "${t}". Check the ticker symbol and try again.` };
  }
  const profile = profileArr[0];
  const income = Array.isArray(incomeArr) && incomeArr.length ? incomeArr[0] : null;
  const balance = Array.isArray(balanceArr) && balanceArr.length ? balanceArr[0] : null;
  if (!income || !balance) {
    throw { type:'invalid', message:`Financial statements unavailable for "${t}". This ticker may not be covered.` };
  }
  return { ticker:t, profile, income, balance };
}

/* =======================================================================
   SCREENING LOGIC
======================================================================= */
function screenBusinessActivity(profile){
  const industryLower = (profile.industry || '').toLowerCase();
  const desc = (profile.description || '').toLowerCase();

  const results = HARAM_CATEGORIES.map(cat => {
    let hit = false;
    if (cat.industryKeywords && cat.industryKeywords.length) {
      hit = cat.industryKeywords.some(k => industryLower.includes(k));
    }
    if (!hit && cat.keywords) {
      hit = cat.keywords.some(k => desc.includes(k) || industryLower.includes(k));
    }
    return { ...cat, hit };
  });
  const failed = results.some(r => r.hit);
  return { results, failed };
}

function safeDiv(a, b){
  if (b === undefined || b === null || b === 0) return null;
  return a / b;
}

function classifyRatio(value, thresh){
  if (value === null || value === undefined || isNaN(value)) {
    return { status:'unknown' };
  }
  const isMax = thresh.max !== undefined;
  const limit = isMax ? thresh.max : thresh.min;
  const pass = isMax ? value <= limit : value >= limit;
  const distance = Math.abs(value - limit) / (limit || 1);
  const doubtful = distance <= DOUBTFUL_MARGIN;
  let status = pass ? 'pass' : 'fail';
  if (doubtful) status = 'doubtful';
  return { status, pass };
}

function screenFinancialRatios(income, balance){
  const totalAssets = balance.totalAssets || 0;
  const totalRevenue = income.revenue || 0;

  const interestBearingDebt = (balance.shortTermDebt || 0) + (balance.longTermDebt || 0);
  const debtToAssets = safeDiv(interestBearingDebt, totalAssets);

  const interestIncome = income.interestIncome || 0;
  const interestIncomeToRevenue = safeDiv(interestIncome, totalRevenue);

  const receivables = balance.netReceivables || 0;
  const receivablesToAssets = safeDiv(receivables, totalAssets);

  const cashAndEquivalents = (balance.cashAndCashEquivalents || 0) + (balance.shortTermInvestments || 0);
  const illiquidAssets = totalAssets - cashAndEquivalents - receivables;
  const illiquidToAssets = safeDiv(illiquidAssets, totalAssets);

  const ratios = [
    {
      key:'debtToAssets', label: RATIO_THRESHOLDS.debtToAssets.label,
      value: debtToAssets, threshold: RATIO_THRESHOLDS.debtToAssets,
      formula: `Interest-Bearing Debt / Total Assets = $${fmtNum(interestBearingDebt)} / $${fmtNum(totalAssets)} = ${fmtPct(debtToAssets)}`,
      thresholdText: '< 30%',
      ...classifyRatio(debtToAssets, RATIO_THRESHOLDS.debtToAssets),
    },
    {
      key:'interestIncomeToRevenue', label: RATIO_THRESHOLDS.interestIncomeToRevenue.label,
      value: interestIncomeToRevenue, threshold: RATIO_THRESHOLDS.interestIncomeToRevenue,
      formula: `Interest Income / Total Revenue = $${fmtNum(interestIncome)} / $${fmtNum(totalRevenue)} = ${fmtPct(interestIncomeToRevenue)}`,
      thresholdText: '< 5%',
      ...classifyRatio(interestIncomeToRevenue, RATIO_THRESHOLDS.interestIncomeToRevenue),
    },
    {
      key:'receivablesToAssets', label: RATIO_THRESHOLDS.receivablesToAssets.label,
      value: receivablesToAssets, threshold: RATIO_THRESHOLDS.receivablesToAssets,
      formula: `Accounts Receivable / Total Assets = $${fmtNum(receivables)} / $${fmtNum(totalAssets)} = ${fmtPct(receivablesToAssets)}`,
      thresholdText: '< 70%',
      ...classifyRatio(receivablesToAssets, RATIO_THRESHOLDS.receivablesToAssets),
    },
    {
      key:'illiquidToAssets', label: RATIO_THRESHOLDS.illiquidToAssets.label,
      value: illiquidToAssets, threshold: RATIO_THRESHOLDS.illiquidToAssets,
      formula: `Illiquid Assets / Total Assets = (Total Assets − Cash − Receivables) / Total Assets = $${fmtNum(illiquidAssets)} / $${fmtNum(totalAssets)} = ${fmtPct(illiquidToAssets)}`,
      thresholdText: '> 33%',
      ...classifyRatio(illiquidToAssets, RATIO_THRESHOLDS.illiquidToAssets),
    },
  ];
  const failed = ratios.some(r => r.status === 'fail' || r.status === 'unknown');
  const doubtful = ratios.some(r => r.status === 'doubtful');
  return { ratios, failed, doubtful };
}

function runScreen(data){
  const activity = screenBusinessActivity(data.profile);
  const ratios = screenFinancialRatios(data.income, data.balance);
  let verdict = 'pass';
  if (activity.failed || ratios.failed) verdict = 'fail';
  else if (ratios.doubtful) verdict = 'doubtful';
  return { activity, ratios, verdict };
}

/* =======================================================================
   FORMATTERS
======================================================================= */
function fmtNum(n){
  if (n === null || n === undefined || isNaN(n)) return 'N/A';
  const abs = Math.abs(n);
  if (abs >= 1e9) return (n/1e9).toFixed(2) + 'B';
  if (abs >= 1e6) return (n/1e6).toFixed(2) + 'M';
  if (abs >= 1e3) return (n/1e3).toFixed(2) + 'K';
  return n.toFixed(0);
}
function fmtPct(v){
  if (v === null || v === undefined || isNaN(v)) return 'N/A';
  return (v*100).toFixed(2) + '%';
}
function fmtPrice(n){
  if (n === null || n === undefined || isNaN(n)) return 'N/A';
  return '$' + n.toFixed(2);
}
function fmtMcap(n){
  if (n === null || n === undefined || isNaN(n)) return 'N/A';
  if (n >= 1e12) return '$' + (n/1e12).toFixed(2) + 'T';
  if (n >= 1e9) return '$' + (n/1e9).toFixed(2) + 'B';
  if (n >= 1e6) return '$' + (n/1e6).toFixed(2) + 'M';
  return '$' + n.toFixed(0);
}
function verdictMeta(v){
  if (v === 'pass') return { icon:'✅', label:'PASS', cls:'pass' };
  if (v === 'fail') return { icon:'❌', label:'FAIL', cls:'fail' };
  return { icon:'⚠️', label:'DOUBTFUL', cls:'doubtful' };
}
function escapeHtml(s){
  return String(s).replace(/[&<>"']/g, c => ({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
}
function formatDate(dateStr){
  if (!dateStr) return 'an unknown date';
  const d = new Date(dateStr + 'T00:00:00');
  if (isNaN(d.getTime())) return dateStr;
  return d.toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year:'numeric', month:'long', day:'numeric' });
}
function sleep(ms){
  return new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, ms));
}
function hexToRgba(hex, alpha){
  const r = parseInt(hex.slice(1,3),16), g = parseInt(hex.slice(3,5),16), b = parseInt(hex.slice(5,7),16);
  return `rgba(${r},${g},${b},${alpha})`;
}

/* =======================================================================
   PAGE: LANDING
======================================================================= */
function renderLanding(){
  const app = document.getElementById('app');
  const passRate = statsToday.count ? Math.round((statsToday.passes/statsToday.count)*100) : 0;
  app.innerHTML = `
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-badge"><span class="dot"></span> AAOIFI Standard Screening Engine</div>
    <h1>Shariah-Compliant<br>Stock Screening</h1>
    <p class="sub">AAOIFI-standard screening for Muslim investors. Instantly verify whether any public stock passes Islamic finance principles.</p>
    <div class="search-wrap">
      <form id="searchForm" class="search-box">
        <input id="tickerInput" type="text" placeholder="Enter a ticker or company name — e.g. AAPL, Apple" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false">
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Screen Now</button>
      </form>
      <div class="autocomplete-dropdown" id="autocompleteDropdown"></div>
    </div>
    <div id="searchErrorSlot"></div>
    ${recentSearches.length ? `
      <div class="recent-searches-wrap">
        <div class="recent-label">Recent Searches</div>
        <div class="recent-pills">
          ${recentSearches.map(t => `<button class="pill" data-ticker="${t}">${t}</button>`).join('')}
        </div>
      </div>` : ''}

    <div class="stats-grid">
      <div class="stat-card accent"><div class="val">${statsToday.count}</div><div class="lbl">Stocks Screened Today</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card accent"><div class="val">${statsToday.count ? passRate + '%' : '—'}</div><div class="lbl">Pass Rate</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card"><div class="val">60+</div><div class="lbl">Markets Covered</div></div>
      <div class="stat-card gold"><div class="val">AAOIFI</div><div class="lbl">Screening Standard</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="popular-section">
      <h3>Popular Stocks</h3>
      <div class="popular-grid" id="popularGrid">
        ${POPULAR_TICKERS.map(t => popularCardSkeleton(t)).join('')}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  `;

  const form = document.getElementById('searchForm');
  const input = document.getElementById('tickerInput');
  input.focus();
  form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    const val = input.value.trim();
    if (!val) return;
    closeAutocomplete();
    navigate('/results', { ticker: val.toUpperCase() });
  });
  document.querySelectorAll('.pill').forEach(p => {
    p.addEventListener('click', () => navigate('/results', { ticker: p.dataset.ticker }));
  });
  setupAutocomplete();

  document.getElementById('popularGrid').addEventListener('click', (e) => {
    const card = e.target.closest('.popular-card');
    if (card) navigate('/results', { ticker: card.dataset.ticker });
  });
  loadPopularStocks();
}

/* =======================================================================
   AUTOCOMPLETE
======================================================================= */
function setupAutocomplete(){
  const input = document.getElementById('tickerInput');
  const dropdown = document.getElementById('autocompleteDropdown');
  if (!input || !dropdown) return;
  let debounceTimer = null;
  input.addEventListener('input', () => {
    const q = input.value.trim();
    clearTimeout(debounceTimer);
    if (q.length < 2) { closeAutocomplete(); return; }
    dropdown.innerHTML = `<div class="ac-loading"><span class="ac-spinner"></span> Searching…</div>`;
    dropdown.classList.add('open');
    debounceTimer = setTimeout(() => runAutocompleteSearch(q), 300);
  });
}

async function runAutocompleteSearch(query){
  const dropdown = document.getElementById('autocompleteDropdown');
  const input = document.getElementById('tickerInput');
  if (!dropdown || !input) return;
  const requestId = ++autocompleteRequestId;
  try {
    const results = await fmpFetch(`/search-symbol?query=${encodeURIComponent(query)}`);
    if (requestId !== autocompleteRequestId) return;
    if (!document.getElementById('autocompleteDropdown')) return;
    if (!Array.isArray(results) || !results.length) {
      dropdown.innerHTML = `<div class="ac-empty">No matches found</div>`;
      dropdown.classList.add('open');
      return;
    }
    const top = results.slice(0, 6);
    dropdown.innerHTML = top.map(r => `
      <div class="ac-item" data-ticker="${escapeHtml(r.symbol)}">
        <span class="ac-sym">${escapeHtml(r.symbol)}</span>
        <span class="ac-name">${escapeHtml(r.name || '')}</span>
        <span class="ac-exch">${escapeHtml(r.exchange || '')}</span>
      </div>
    `).join('');
    dropdown.classList.add('open');
    dropdown.querySelectorAll('.ac-item').forEach(item => {
      item.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const t = item.dataset.ticker;
        input.value = t;
        closeAutocomplete();
        navigate('/results', { ticker: t });
      });
    });
  } catch (e) {
    if (requestId !== autocompleteRequestId) return;
    if (!document.getElementById('autocompleteDropdown')) return;
    dropdown.innerHTML = `<div class="ac-empty">Search unavailable right now</div>`;
    dropdown.classList.add('open');
  }
}

function closeAutocomplete(){
  const dropdown = document.getElementById('autocompleteDropdown');
  if (dropdown) { dropdown.classList.remove('open'); dropdown.innerHTML = ''; }
}

/* =======================================================================
   POPULAR STOCKS
======================================================================= */
const POPULAR_CACHE_KEY = 'safiscreen_popular_cache';
const POPULAR_CACHE_TTL = 6 * 60 * 60 * 1000;

function popularCardSkeleton(t){
  return `
  <div class="popular-card" id="popular-${t}" data-ticker="${t}">
    <div class="pc-top">
      <span class="pc-tk">${t}</span>
      <span class="skel" style="width:52px;height:18px;border-radius:100px;display:inline-block;"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="skel" style="width:75%;height:11px;border-radius:4px;"></div>
  </div>`;
}
function popularCardLoaded(t, info){
  if (!info || info.error || !info.verdict) {
    return `
    <div class="popular-card" id="popular-${t}" data-ticker="${t}">
      <div class="pc-top"><span class="pc-tk">${t}</span><span class="badge-sm" style="color:var(--text-faint);background:var(--bg-elev3);">N/A</span></div>
      <div class="pc-name">${escapeHtml((info && info.name) || t)}</div>
    </div>`;
  }
  const vm = verdictMeta(info.verdict);
  return `
  <div class="popular-card" id="popular-${t}" data-ticker="${t}">
    <div class="pc-top"><span class="pc-tk">${t}</span><span class="badge-sm ${vm.cls}">${vm.icon} ${vm.label}</span></div>
    <div class="pc-name">${escapeHtml(info.name)}</div>
  </div>`;
}
function updatePopularCard(ticker, info){
  const card = document.getElementById(`popular-${ticker}`);
  if (!card) return;
  card.outerHTML = popularCardLoaded(ticker, info);
}

async function loadPopularStocks(){
  const cache = store.get(POPULAR_CACHE_KEY, null);
  const now = Date.now();
  const fresh = (cache && (now - cache.timestamp < POPULAR_CACHE_TTL)) ? cache.data : {};

  POPULAR_TICKERS.forEach(t => { if (fresh[t]) updatePopularCard(t, fresh[t]); });

  const toFetch = POPULAR_TICKERS.filter(t => !fresh[t]);
  if (!toFetch.length) return;

  const results = { ...fresh };
  const BATCH = 4;
  for (let i = 0; i < toFetch.length; i += BATCH) {
    if (!document.getElementById('popularGrid')) return;
    const batch = toFetch.slice(i, i + BATCH);
    await Promise.all(batch.map(async t => {
      try {
        const data = await fetchCompanyData(t);
        const screen = runScreen(data);
        const info = { name: data.profile.companyName || t, verdict: screen.verdict };
        results[t] = info;
        updatePopularCard(t, info);
      } catch (e) {
        const info = { name: t, verdict: null, error: true };
        results[t] = info;
        updatePopularCard(t, info);
      }
    }));
  }
  store.set(POPULAR_CACHE_KEY, { timestamp: now, data: results });
}

/* =======================================================================
   PAGE: RESULTS
======================================================================= */
const SCAN_CRITERIA_LABELS = [
  ...HARAM_CATEGORIES.map(c => c.label),
  ...Object.values(RATIO_THRESHOLDS).map(t => t.label),
];

function renderScanShell(ticker){
  const app = document.getElementById('app');
  app.innerHTML = `
  <div class="page">
    <div class="scan-loading">
      <div class="scan-orb"></div>
      <div class="scan-ticker mono">${escapeHtml(ticker)}</div>
      <div class="scan-company" id="scanCompanyName">Fetching company profile…</div>
      <div class="scan-list" id="scanList"></div>
    </div>
  </div>`;
}

async function runScanAnimation(labels, token){
  for (const label of labels) {
    if (token !== currentResultsToken) return;
    const list = document.getElementById('scanList');
    if (!list) return;
    const item = document.createElement('div');
    item.className = 'scan-item';
    item.innerHTML = `<span class="scan-check">✓</span> Analyzing ${escapeHtml(label)}…`;
    list.appendChild(item);
    await sleep(150);
  }
}

async function renderResults(query){
  const ticker = (query.get('ticker') || '').toUpperCase();
  const app = document.getElementById('app');
  if (!ticker) { navigate('/'); return; }

  const token = ++currentResultsToken;
  renderScanShell(ticker);

  const sym = encodeURIComponent(ticker);
  let profile;
  try {
    const profileArr = await fmpFetch(`/profile?symbol=${sym}`);
    if (token !== currentResultsToken) return;
    if (!Array.isArray(profileArr) || !profileArr.length) {
      throw { type:'invalid', message:`No data found for "${ticker}". Check the ticker symbol and try again.` };
    }
    profile = profileArr[0];
  } catch (err) {
    if (token !== currentResultsToken) return;
    renderResultsError(err, ticker);
    return;
  }

  const scanCompanyEl = document.getElementById('scanCompanyName');
  if (scanCompanyEl) scanCompanyEl.textContent = profile.companyName || ticker;

  const animPromise = runScanAnimation(SCAN_CRITERIA_LABELS, token);
  const dataPromise = Promise.all([
    fmpFetch(`/income-statement?symbol=${sym}&limit=1`),
    fmpFetch(`/balance-sheet-statement?symbol=${sym}&limit=1`),
    fmpFetch(`/quote?symbol=${sym}`).catch(() => []),
    fmpFetch(`/ratios?symbol=${sym}&limit=1`).catch(() => []),
  ]);

  let incomeArr, balanceArr, quoteArr, ratiosArr;
  try {
    [incomeArr, balanceArr, quoteArr, ratiosArr] = await dataPromise;
  } catch (err) {
    if (token !== currentResultsToken) return;
    renderResultsError(err, ticker);
    return;
  }
  await animPromise;
  if (token !== currentResultsToken) return;

  const income = Array.isArray(incomeArr) && incomeArr.length ? incomeArr[0] : null;
  const balance = Array.isArray(balanceArr) && balanceArr.length ? balanceArr[0] : null;
  if (!income || !balance) {
    renderResultsError({ type:'invalid', message:`Financial statements unavailable for "${ticker}". This ticker may not be covered.` }, ticker);
    return;
  }
  const quote = Array.isArray(quoteArr) && quoteArr.length ? quoteArr[0] : {};
  const ratiosData = Array.isArray(ratiosArr) && ratiosArr.length ? ratiosArr[0] : {};

  const data = { ticker, profile, income, balance };
  const screen = runScreen(data);

  statsToday.count++;
  if (screen.verdict === 'pass') statsToday.passes++;
  store.set('safiscreen_stats', statsToday);
  recentSearches = [ticker, ...recentSearches.filter(t => t !== ticker)].slice(0, 10);
  store.set('safiscreen_recent', recentSearches);

  const vm = verdictMeta(screen.verdict);
  const isInWatchlist = watchlist.some(w => w.ticker === ticker);
  const disclaimerDismissed = store.get('safiscreen_disclaimer_dismissed', false);

  const logoHtml = profile.image
    ? `<img src="${profile.image}" alt="${ticker} logo" onerror="this.parentElement.innerHTML='<div class=\\'fallback\\'>${ticker.slice(0,2)}</div>'">`
    : `<div class="fallback">${ticker.slice(0,2)}</div>`;

  const peVal = (ratiosData.priceToEarningsRatio !== undefined && ratiosData.priceToEarningsRatio !== null && isFinite(ratiosData.priceToEarningsRatio))
    ? ratiosData.priceToEarningsRatio.toFixed(2) : 'N/A';
  const divYieldVal = (ratiosData.dividendYieldPercentage !== undefined && ratiosData.dividendYieldPercentage !== null)
    ? ratiosData.dividendYieldPercentage.toFixed(2) + '%' : 'N/A';
  const currentPrice = quote.price ?? profile.price;
  const currentMcap = quote.marketCap ?? profile.marketCap;

  const interestRatio = screen.ratios.ratios.find(r => r.key === 'interestIncomeToRevenue');
  const purifyValue = (interestRatio && interestRatio.value !== null && !isNaN(interestRatio.value)) ? interestRatio.value : 0;
  const purifyDollar = (purifyValue * 1000).toFixed(2);

  app.innerHTML = `
  <div class="page">
    ${!disclaimerDismissed ? `
    <div class="disclaimer-banner no-print" id="disclaimerBanner">
      <span>⚠️ This screening is for informational purposes only and does not constitute a fatwa or religious ruling. Consult a qualified Islamic finance scholar for personal investment decisions.</span>
      <button class="db-close" id="disclaimerClose" title="Dismiss">✕</button>
    </div>` : ''}

    <div class="company-header">
      <div class="company-logo">${logoHtml}</div>
      <div class="company-meta">
        <h2>${escapeHtml(profile.companyName || ticker)} <span class="ticker-tag">${ticker}</span></h2>
        <div class="sub-meta">
          <span>${escapeHtml(profile.sector || 'Unknown Sector')}</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>${escapeHtml(profile.industry || 'Unknown Industry')}</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>${escapeHtml(profile.exchangeShortName || profile.exchange || '')}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="company-price">
        <div class="price mono">${fmtPrice(currentPrice)}</div>
        <div class="mcap">Market Cap: ${fmtMcap(currentMcap)}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="freshness-note">Financial data based on ${formatDate(balance.date)} annual report.</div>

    <div class="enrich-grid">
      <div class="enrich-tile"><div class="et-lbl">Price</div><div class="et-val">${fmtPrice(currentPrice)}</div></div>
      <div class="enrich-tile"><div class="et-lbl">Market Cap</div><div class="et-val">${fmtMcap(currentMcap)}</div></div>
      <div class="enrich-tile"><div class="et-lbl">P/E Ratio</div><div class="et-val">${peVal}</div></div>
      <div class="enrich-tile"><div class="et-lbl">Dividend Yield</div><div class="et-val">${divYieldVal}</div></div>
      <div class="enrich-tile"><div class="et-lbl">52-Week Range</div><div class="et-val" style="font-size:14px;">${fmtPrice(quote.yearLow)} – ${fmtPrice(quote.yearHigh)}</div></div>
    </div>

    <div class="verdict-badge ${vm.cls}"><span class="icon">${vm.icon}</span> SHARIAH ${vm.label}</div>

    <div class="chart-card">
      <div class="chart-head">
        <div class="chart-stats" id="chartStats">
          <div class="cs-price">${fmtPrice(currentPrice)}</div>
          <div class="cs-change">Loading price history…</div>
        </div>
        <div class="range-btns no-print" id="rangeBtns">
          ${['1D','1W','1M','6M','1Y'].map(r => `<button type="button" class="range-btn ${r === '1M' ? 'active' : ''}" data-range="${r}">${r}</button>`).join('')}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="chart-canvas-wrap" id="chartCanvasWrap">
        <canvas id="priceChart"></canvas>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="panels">
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>🕌 Business Activity Screen</h3>
        <div class="activity-list">
          ${screen.activity.results.map(r => `
            <div class="activity-item ${r.hit ? 'fail-item' : 'pass-item'}">
              <span>${r.label}</span>
              <span class="status">${r.hit ? '❌' : '✅'}</span>
            </div>
          `).join('')}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="panel">
        <h3>📊 Financial Ratios</h3>
        <table class="ratio-table">
          <thead><tr><th>Ratio</th><th>Value</th><th>Threshold</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            ${screen.ratios.ratios.map(r => `
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <div class="ratio-name">${r.label}</div>
                  <div class="ratio-formula">${r.formula}</div>
                </td>
                <td class="ratio-val">${fmtPct(r.value)}</td>
                <td class="ratio-val" style="color:var(--text-faint)">${r.thresholdText}</td>
                <td><span class="ratio-status ${r.status === 'unknown' ? 'fail' : r.status}">${r.status === 'unknown' ? 'N/A' : r.status}</span></td>
              </tr>
            `).join('')}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    ${(screen.verdict === 'pass' || screen.verdict === 'doubtful') ? `
    <div class="purify-box">
      <h4>🪙 Purification Ratio</h4>
      <div class="purify-formula">(Interest Income / Total Revenue) × 100 = ${fmtPct(purifyValue)}</div>
      <div class="purify-note">For every <b>$1,000</b> in dividends received from ${escapeHtml(profile.companyName || ticker)}, donate <b>$${purifyDollar}</b> to charity to purify your investment income, per AAOIFI guidelines.</div>
    </div>` : ''}

    <div class="verdict-box ${vm.cls}">
      <h4>${vm.icon} Overall Verdict: Shariah ${vm.label}</h4>
      <p>${buildVerdictSentence(profile, screen)}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="results-actions no-print">
      <button class="btn btn-primary" id="saveWatchlistBtn">${isInWatchlist ? '✓ Saved to Watchlist' : '+ Save to Watchlist'}</button>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="exportPdfBtn">Export PDF</button>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary" id="shareBtn">Share Result</button>
      <a href="#/" class="btn btn-ghost">Screen Another</a>
    </div>

    <div class="print-footer">Generated by SafiScreen · ${new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US',{year:'numeric',month:'long',day:'numeric'})} · Informational purposes only — not a fatwa or religious ruling. Consult a qualified Islamic finance scholar.</div>
  </div>
  `;

  if (token !== currentResultsToken) return;

  const disclaimerCloseBtn = document.getElementById('disclaimerClose');
  if (disclaimerCloseBtn) {
    disclaimerCloseBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      store.set('safiscreen_disclaimer_dismissed', true);
      const banner = document.getElementById('disclaimerBanner');
      if (banner) banner.remove();
    });
  }

  document.getElementById('saveWatchlistBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (watchlist.some(w => w.ticker === ticker)) {
      showToast(`${ticker} is already in your watchlist`);
      return;
    }
    watchlist.unshift({
      ticker,
      name: profile.companyName || ticker,
      verdict: screen.verdict,
      date: new Date().toISOString(),
    });
    store.set('safiscreen_watchlist', watchlist);
    document.getElementById('saveWatchlistBtn').textContent = '✓ Saved to Watchlist';
    showToast(`${ticker} added to watchlist`);
  });

  document.getElementById('exportPdfBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
    window.print();
  });

  document.getElementById('shareBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
    const link = `${SHARE_BASE_URL}#/screen?ticker=${ticker}`;
    navigator.clipboard.writeText(link).then(() => {
      showToast('Link copied!');
    }).catch(() => {
      showToast('Could not copy — clipboard unavailable');
    });
  });

  const chartColor = vm.cls === 'pass' ? '#10B981' : vm.cls === 'fail' ? '#EF4444' : '#F59E0B';
  document.getElementById('rangeBtns').addEventListener('click', (e) => {
    const btn = e.target.closest('.range-btn');
    if (!btn) return;
    renderChartRange(btn.dataset.range, chartColor);
  });
  initPriceChart(ticker, chartColor, token);
}

/* =======================================================================
   PRICE CHART
======================================================================= */
async function initPriceChart(ticker, color, token){
  try {
    const sym = encodeURIComponent(ticker);
    const to = new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10);
    const fromD = new Date(); fromD.setDate(fromD.getDate() - 400);
    const from = fromD.toISOString().slice(0,10);
    const raw = await fmpFetch(`/historical-price-eod/light?symbol=${sym}&from=${from}&to=${to}`);
    if (token !== currentResultsToken) return;
    if (!Array.isArray(raw) || raw.length < 2) {
      const wrap = document.getElementById('chartCanvasWrap');
      if (wrap) wrap.innerHTML = `<div class="chart-empty">Price history unavailable for ${escapeHtml(ticker)}.</div>`;
      return;
    }
    priceHistoryCache = raw.slice().reverse();
    renderChartRange('1M', color);
  } catch (e) {
    if (token !== currentResultsToken) return;
    const wrap = document.getElementById('chartCanvasWrap');
    if (wrap) wrap.innerHTML = `<div class="chart-empty">Unable to load price history.</div>`;
  }
}

function filterChartRange(rangeKey){
  if (!priceHistoryCache.length) return [];
  if (rangeKey === '1D') return priceHistoryCache.slice(-2);
  const days = { '1W':7, '1M':30, '6M':182, '1Y':365 }[rangeKey];
  const cutoff = new Date(); cutoff.setDate(cutoff.getDate() - days);
  const filtered = priceHistoryCache.filter(p => new Date(p.date) >= cutoff);
  return filtered.length >= 2 ? filtered : priceHistoryCache.slice(-2);
}

function renderChartRange(rangeKey, color){
  document.querySelectorAll('.range-btn').forEach(b => b.classList.toggle('active', b.dataset.range === rangeKey));
  const points = filterChartRange(rangeKey);
  if (!points.length) return;
  const first = points[0].price, last = points[points.length - 1].price;
  const change = last - first;
  const changePct = first ? (change / first) * 100 : 0;
  const statsEl = document.getElementById('chartStats');
  if (statsEl) {
    const sign = change >= 0 ? '+' : '';
    statsEl.innerHTML = `
      <div class="cs-price">${fmtPrice(last)}</div>
      <div class="cs-change ${change >= 0 ? 'up' : 'down'}">${sign}${change.toFixed(2)} (${sign}${changePct.toFixed(2)}%) · ${rangeKey}</div>
    `;
  }
  const canvas = document.getElementById('priceChart');
  if (!canvas || typeof Chart === 'undefined') return;
  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
  const gradient = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, 0, 280);
  gradient.addColorStop(0, hexToRgba(color, 0.35));
  gradient.addColorStop(1, hexToRgba(color, 0));

  const labels = points.map(p => p.date);
  const data = points.map(p => p.price);

  if (priceChartInstance) { priceChartInstance.destroy(); }
  priceChartInstance = new Chart(ctx, {
    type: 'line',
    data: { labels, datasets: [{ data, borderColor: color, backgroundColor: gradient, fill: true, tension: 0.35, pointRadius: 0, borderWidth: 2.2 }] },
    options: {
      responsive: true, maintainAspectRatio: false,
      scales: {
        x: { grid: { color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.04)' }, ticks: { color: '#6B6B78', maxTicksLimit: 6, autoSkip: true } },
        y: { grid: { color: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.04)' }, ticks: { color: '#6B6B78' } }
      },
      plugins: {
        legend: { display: false },
        tooltip: { backgroundColor: '#1C1C28', borderColor: '#26262F', borderWidth: 1, titleColor: '#F5F5F7', bodyColor: '#A0A0AC', padding: 10 }
      },
      interaction: { mode: 'index', intersect: false }
    }
  });
}

function buildVerdictSentence(profile, screen){
  const name = escapeHtml(profile.companyName || 'This company');
  if (screen.verdict === 'pass') {
    return `${name} passed both the business activity screen and all AAOIFI financial ratio thresholds. No haram business lines were detected, and interest-bearing debt, interest income, receivables, and liquid asset ratios all fall within acceptable limits.`;
  }
  if (screen.verdict === 'fail') {
    const failedActivities = screen.activity.results.filter(r => r.hit).map(r => r.label);
    const failedRatios = screen.ratios.ratios.filter(r => r.status === 'fail' || r.status === 'unknown').map(r => r.label);
    const parts = [];
    if (failedActivities.length) parts.push(`operates in prohibited activity: ${failedActivities.join(', ')}`);
    if (failedRatios.length) parts.push(`fails ratio threshold(s): ${failedRatios.join(', ')}`);
    return `${name} does not meet AAOIFI Shariah compliance requirements. It ${parts.join('; and ')}.`;
  }
  const doubtfulRatios = screen.ratios.ratios.filter(r => r.status === 'doubtful').map(r => r.label);
  return `${name} passes the business activity screen, but one or more financial ratios (${doubtfulRatios.join(', ')}) sit within 5% of the AAOIFI threshold. A qualified Shariah advisor should review this stock before investment.`;
}

function renderResultsError(err, ticker){
  const app = document.getElementById('app');
  const messages = {
    invalid: { icn:'🔍', title:'Ticker Not Found' },
    limit: { icn:'⏳', title:'API Limit Reached' },
    network: { icn:'📡', title:'Network Error' },
  };
  const meta = messages[err.type] || { icn:'⚠️', title:'Something Went Wrong' };
  app.innerHTML = `
  <div class="page">
    <div class="error-box">
      <div class="icn">${meta.icn}</div>
      <h3>${meta.title}</h3>
      <p>${escapeHtml(err.message || 'Please try again.')}</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;">
        <a href="#/" class="btn btn-secondary">Back to Search</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>`;
}

/* =======================================================================
   PAGE: WATCHLIST
======================================================================= */
function renderWatchlist(){
  const app = document.getElementById('app');
  if (!watchlist.length) {
    app.innerHTML = `
    <div class="page">
      <div class="page-head"><h1>Watchlist</h1><p>Stocks you've saved for future reference.</p></div>
      <div class="empty-state">
        <div class="icn">📋</div>
        <h3>Your watchlist is empty</h3>
        <p>Screen a stock and save it to build your watchlist.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:20px;"><a href="#/" class="btn btn-primary">Screen a Stock</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>`;
    return;
  }

  app.innerHTML = `
  <div class="page">
    <div class="page-head"><h1>Watchlist</h1><p>${watchlist.length} stock${watchlist.length !== 1 ? 's' : ''} saved.</p></div>
    <div class="watchlist-grid">
      ${watchlist.map((w, i) => {
        const vm = verdictMeta(w.verdict);
        const d = new Date(w.date);
        return `
        <div class="wl-card" data-ticker="${w.ticker}">
          <div class="wl-card-top">
            <div>
              <div class="tk mono">${w.ticker}</div>
              <div class="nm">${escapeHtml(w.name)}</div>
            </div>
            <button class="wl-remove" data-idx="${i}" title="Remove">✕</button>
          </div>
          <div class="wl-card-bottom">
            <span class="badge-sm ${vm.cls}">${vm.icon} ${vm.label}</span>
            <span class="wl-date">${d.toLocaleDateString()}</span>
          </div>
        </div>`;
      }).join('')}
    </div>
  </div>`;

  document.querySelectorAll('.wl-remove').forEach(btn => {
    btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
      e.stopPropagation();
      const idx = parseInt(btn.dataset.idx, 10);
      const removed = watchlist[idx];
      watchlist.splice(idx, 1);
      store.set('safiscreen_watchlist', watchlist);
      showToast(`${removed.ticker} removed from watchlist`);
      renderWatchlist();
    });
  });
  document.querySelectorAll('.wl-card').forEach(card => {
    card.addEventListener('click', () => {
      navigate('/results', { ticker: card.dataset.ticker });
    });
  });
}

/* =======================================================================
   PAGE: COMPARE
======================================================================= */
function renderCompare(){
  const app = document.getElementById('app');
  app.innerHTML = `
  <div class="page">
    <div class="page-head"><h1>Compare Stocks</h1><p>Screen up to 3 tickers side by side.</p></div>
    <form id="compareForm" class="compare-inputs">
      ${[1,2,3].map(n => `
        <div class="compare-input-wrap">
          <div class="num">${n}</div>
          <input type="text" id="cmp${n}" placeholder="Ticker" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="characters" spellcheck="false">
        </div>
      `).join('')}
    </form>
    <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:32px;">
      <button id="compareBtn" class="btn btn-primary">Compare</button>
    </div>
    <div id="compareResults"></div>
  </div>`;

  document.getElementById('compareForm').addEventListener('submit', e => e.preventDefault());
  document.getElementById('compareBtn').addEventListener('click', async () => {
    const tickers = [1,2,3].map(n => document.getElementById(`cmp${n}`).value.trim().toUpperCase()).filter(Boolean);
    if (tickers.length < 2) {
      showToast('Enter at least 2 tickers to compare');
      return;
    }
    const resultsEl = document.getElementById('compareResults');
    resultsEl.innerHTML = `<div class="skeleton-wrap"><div class="skel skel-row" style="height:340px;"></div></div>`;

    const outcomes = await Promise.all(tickers.map(async t => {
      try {
        const data = await fetchCompanyData(t);
        const screen = runScreen(data);
        return { ticker:t, data, screen, error:null };
      } catch (err) {
        return { ticker:t, error:err };
      }
    }));

    renderCompareTable(outcomes);
  });
}

function renderCompareTable(outcomes){
  const resultsEl = document.getElementById('compareResults');
  const valid = outcomes.filter(o => !o.error);
  const errored = outcomes.filter(o => o.error);

  let errorHtml = '';
  if (errored.length) {
    errorHtml = `<div style="margin-bottom:16px;">${errored.map(o => `
      <div class="search-error" style="max-width:none;margin-bottom:8px;">${o.ticker}: ${escapeHtml(o.error.message)}</div>
    `).join('')}</div>`;
  }

  if (!valid.length) {
    resultsEl.innerHTML = errorHtml;
    return;
  }

  const rows = [
    { label:'Verdict', get: o => { const vm = verdictMeta(o.screen.verdict); return { text:`${vm.icon} ${vm.label}`, cls:vm.cls }; } },
    ...HARAM_CATEGORIES.map(cat => ({
      label: cat.label,
      get: o => {
        const r = o.screen.activity.results.find(x => x.key === cat.key);
        return r.hit ? { text:'❌ Fail', cls:'fail' } : { text:'✅ Pass', cls:'pass' };
      }
    })),
    ...Object.keys(RATIO_THRESHOLDS).map(key => ({
      label: RATIO_THRESHOLDS[key].label,
      get: o => {
        const r = o.screen.ratios.ratios.find(x => x.key === key);
        return { text: `${fmtPct(r.value)}`, cls: r.status === 'unknown' ? 'fail' : r.status };
      }
    })),
  ];

  resultsEl.innerHTML = errorHtml + `
    <div class="compare-table-wrap">
      <table class="compare-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Criteria</th>
            ${valid.map(o => `<th>${o.ticker}<br><span style="font-weight:500;text-transform:none;color:var(--text-faint);">${escapeHtml(o.data.profile.companyName || '')}</span></th>`).join('')}
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          ${rows.map(row => `
            <tr>
              <td class="crit-label">${row.label}</td>
              ${valid.map(o => {
                const cell = row.get(o);
                return `<td class="cell-${cell.cls}">${cell.text}</td>`;
              }).join('')}
            </tr>
          `).join('')}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  `;
}

/* =======================================================================
   PAGE: ABOUT / METHODOLOGY
======================================================================= */
function renderAbout(){
  const app = document.getElementById('app');
  app.innerHTML = `
  <div class="page">
    <div class="page-head"><h1>Methodology</h1><p>How SafiScreen determines Shariah compliance.</p></div>

    <div class="method-section">
      <h2>The <span class="accent">AAOIFI</span> Standard</h2>
      <p>SafiScreen applies the Shariah screening methodology published by the Accounting and Auditing Organization for Islamic Financial Institutions (AAOIFI) — the leading global standard-setting body for Islamic finance. AAOIFI's Shariah Standard No. 21 on "Financial Paper (Shares and Bonds)" defines the criteria used to determine whether a publicly traded company is permissible for Muslim investors.</p>
      <p>Screening happens in two layers: a qualitative business activity screen, followed by quantitative financial ratio thresholds. A company must pass both layers to be considered Shariah-compliant.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="method-section">
      <h2>Layer 1 — Business Activity Screen</h2>
      <p>A company automatically fails if its primary business involves any of the following:</p>
      <div class="crit-list">
        ${HARAM_CATEGORIES.map(c => `<div class="crit-row"><span class="cname">${c.label}</span><span class="cthresh">Automatic Fail</span></div>`).join('')}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="method-section">
      <h2>Layer 2 — Financial Ratios</h2>
      <p>Companies that clear the business activity screen must also satisfy all of the following ratio thresholds, calculated from the most recent annual balance sheet and income statement:</p>
      <div class="crit-list">
        ${Object.values(RATIO_THRESHOLDS).map(t => `
          <div class="crit-row">
            <span class="cname">${t.label}</span>
            <span class="cthresh">${t.max !== undefined ? '< ' + (t.max*100) + '%' : '> ' + (t.min*100) + '%'}</span>
          </div>
        `).join('')}
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top:16px;">A ratio result within 5% (relative) of its threshold is flagged <strong style="color:var(--amber)">⚠️ Doubtful</strong> rather than an outright pass, since small data or classification variances could change the outcome. In that case, we recommend consulting a qualified Shariah advisor.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="method-section">
      <h2>Data Sources</h2>
      <p>Company profile, sector/industry classification, income statement, and balance sheet data are sourced from the <strong>Financial Modeling Prep API</strong>. Data reflects the most recently reported fiscal period available and may lag real-time filings. SafiScreen does not independently verify FMP's data accuracy — results should be treated as a screening aid, not a final fatwa.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="method-section">
      <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>SafiScreen is an informational tool only and does not constitute investment advice or a religious ruling (fatwa). Always consult a qualified Shariah scholar or advisor before making investment decisions.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-card">
      <div class="about-avatar">AB</div>
      <div class="who">
        <b>Built by Abdullah Baig</b>
        <div>University of Waterloo — Bachelor of Sustainability and Financial Management</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>`;
}

/* =======================================================================
   INIT
======================================================================= */
router();
</script>
</body>
</html>
